+## 7. Performance
+
+Measured locally over gzip, cold cache, 1440×900.
+
+| | Before | After |
+|---|---|---|
+| Requests, home | 9 | **8** |
+| Transferred, home | 138.1 KB | **129.2 KB** |
+| CSS transferred | 23.0 KB, two files, per page | **13.1 KB, one file, site-wide** |
