-    <div><p class="eyebrow">About Alexander Watson</p><h1>I make websites, and I understand the work they need to hold.</h1><p class="hero-lead">I am an independent website designer and counsellor-in-training in Greater Manchester. The Studio brings those two ways of thinking together: careful digital craft and a genuine understanding of how a therapy practice needs to feel.</p><div class="button-row"><a href="{{ '/work/' | relative_url }}" class="button button-dark">Browse the website collection</a><a href="{{ '/contact/' | relative_url }}" class="text-link">Tell me what you need <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
