+---
+layout: default
+title: The website collection
+description: Eight original website directions for therapists and counselling services. Browse by practice type, audience and atmosphere, then choose the one to make your own.
+permalink: /work/
+page_js: /assets/js/website-library.js
+---
+
+{% assign harbour = site.data.collection | where: "key", "harbour" | first %}
+
+<section class="band band--sm on-paper">
+  <div class="wrap">
+    <div class="split split--wide-left">
+      <div>
+        <p class="label">The collection</p>
+        <h1 class="measure-2xs">Find the one that already feels like your practice.</h1>
+      </div>
+      <div class="stack stack--loose" style="align-self:end">
+        <p class="lead measure-xl">
+          Eight complete, original directions. Seven are available to choose from;
+          the eighth is my own practice, shown so the standard can be judged on a
+          live website rather than a demonstration.
+        </p>
+        <p class="small quiet measure-2xl">
+          You choose the closest starting point. I make the detailed design
+          decisions from there &mdash; and the direction is rebuilt around your
+          practice rather than recoloured.
+        </p>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</section>
+
+<section class="band band--sm on-sage">
+  <div class="wrap--wide" data-website-library>
+    <div class="library-tools">
+      <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter directions">
+        <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-filter="all">All</button>
+        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="solo">Solo therapist</button>
+        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="centre">Centres &amp; services</button>
+        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="families">Families</button>
+        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="warm">Warm</button>
+        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="editorial">Editorial</button>
+        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="accessible">Accessible</button>
+      </div>
+      <label class="search-field">
+        <span>Search the collection</span>
+        <input type="search" data-website-search placeholder="Try warm, families or editorial">
+      </label>
+    </div>
+
+    <p class="results-line" aria-live="polite">
+      <span data-results-count>08 directions</span>
+      <span data-results-message>Showing the complete collection</span>
+    </p>
+
+    <h2 class="sr-only">The website collection</h2>
+
+    <div class="collection" data-project-grid>
+      {% for d in site.data.collection %}
+        {% assign target = '/contact/?design=' | append: d.name | url_encode %}
+        <article
+          class="direction{% if d.feature %} direction--feature{% endif %}"
+          id="{{ d.key }}"
+          data-project
+          data-search="{{ d.search }}"
+        >
+          <div class="direction__inner">
+            <a class="direction__link"
+               href="{% if d.href %}{{ d.href }}{% else %}{{ target | relative_url }}{% endif %}"
+               {% if d.href %}target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}
+               aria-label="{% if d.href %}Visit {{ d.name | strip_html }}{% else %}Ask about the {{ d.name | strip_html }} direction{% endif %}">
+              <div class="plate-frame">{% include plate.html d=d %}</div>
+            </a>
+
+            <div class="direction__meta">
+              <p class="direction__ref"><span>{{ d.ref }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ d.practice }}</span><span>{{ d.atmosphere }}</span></p>
+              <h3 class="direction__name">{{ d.name }}</h3>
+              <p class="direction__note">{{ d.note }}</p>
+              <p class="plate-swatches" aria-hidden="true">
+                <i style="background:{{ d.paper }}"></i>
+                <i style="background:{{ d.soft }}"></i>
+                <i style="background:{{ d.accent }}"></i>
+                <i style="background:{{ d.ink }}"></i>
+              </p>
+              <div class="direction__foot">
+                <ul class="tags">{% for tag in d.tags %}<li>{{ tag }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
+                {% if d.available == false %}
+                  <a class="direction__go" href="{{ d.href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit the live site <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
+                {% else %}
+                  <a class="direction__go" href="{{ target | relative_url }}">Ask about this direction <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
+                {% endif %}
+              </div>
+            </div>
+          </div>
+        </article>
+      {% endfor %}
+    </div>
+
+    <div class="no-results" data-no-results hidden>
+      <h2>No exact match.</h2>
+      <p>Try a broader word, or clear the filters and browse by feel.</p>
+      <button type="button" class="btn" data-reset-library>Show all directions</button>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</section>
+
+<section class="band on-paper">
+  <div class="wrap--wide">
+    <div class="split split--wide-right align-center">
+      <div class="stack stack--loose">
+        <p class="label">On a phone</p>
+        <h2 class="measure-xs">Most of the people reading are on a phone, and some of them are not calm.</h2>
+        <p class="quiet">
+          The phone view is not the desktop one stacked up: the hierarchy is
+          re-decided, the type re-set, and the thing a distressed reader needs first
+          moved to where they will find it. Every direction is tested to
+          WCAG&nbsp;2.2&nbsp;AA.
+        </p>
+      </div>
+      <div class="align-center" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 0.7fr;gap:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem)">
+        <div class="plate-frame">{% include plate.html d=harbour %}</div>
+        <div>{% include plate.html d=harbour phone="true" %}</div>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</section>
+
+<section class="band band--sm on-sage">
+  <div class="wrap">
+    <div class="split split--wide-left">
+      <div>
+        <p class="label">If more than one feels right</p>
+        <h2 class="measure-2xs">You do not have to choose alone.</h2>
+      </div>
+      <div class="stack stack--loose">
+        <p class="quiet">
+          Send me the two or three you keep returning to and tell me what you like
+          about each. I will say which is the strongest starting point &mdash; and a
+          direction can borrow a feature from another where that improves the result.
+        </p>
+        <p><a class="tlink" href="{{ '/contact/' | relative_url }}">Tell me which ones <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</section>
+
+<section class="band on-ink">
+  <div class="wrap">
+    <div class="split split--wide-left">
+      <div>
+        <p class="label">Found a direction?</p>
+        <h2 class="measure-xs">Name the one you keep coming back to.</h2>
+      </div>
+      <div class="stack stack--loose">
+        <p>Tell me the direction and what is already written.</p>
+        <div class="actions">
+          <a class="btn" href="{{ '/contact/' | relative_url }}">Start a website<span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
+          <a class="tlink" href="{{ '/service/' | relative_url }}">What it costs <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</section>
--- a/assets/css/catalogue-refresh.css
